      "short": "Art, Music, Biology, Latin, Physics, German.",
      "worked": "Convert the results to decimals:\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\text{Art: }\\frac{14}{15}&=0.9\\overline{3}\\\\\n\\text{Biology: }64\\%&=0.64\\\\\n\\text{German: }49\\%&=0.49\\\\\n\\text{Latin: }\\frac{25}{43}&=0.581395348837\\ldots\\\\\n\\text{Music: }\\frac{11}{15}&=0.7\\overline{3}\\\\\n\\text{Physics: }54\\%&=0.54\n\\end{align*}$$\nFrom greatest to least:\n$$0.9\\overline{3}>0.7\\overline{3}>0.64>0.581395348837\\ldots>0.54>0.49.$$\nArt, Music, Biology, Latin, Physics, German.",
